      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REVOLUTION RISING (2) is long overdue. Has placed four of his last five runs, the latest when he raced on the speed from the outset and finished second, beaten half a length, over 1100m here behind Lean On Me. Has the inside and looks hard to run down. SNICK (5) was out of the money when resuming two runs back then made late ground after getting well back when fifth in the same race behind Lean On Me. Has her share of talent. Hard to hold out late. Another to come through that race was JACKSET (6) who finished fourth. Will strip much fitter and expected to be in the finish.  FRANKFURT (3) will find this easier and can improve sharply. ONLY THE BEST (4) next best.",
